><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Note: The Internal Assessment performance and attendance status of each student will be communicated to the respective parents.</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335559685&quot;:23}\">&nbsp;</span>\n\n<span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:160}\">&nbsp;</span>\n<table class=\"center\" width=\"100%\" data-tablestyle=\"MsoNormalTable\" data-tablelook=\"1184\" aria-rowcount=\"7\">\n<tbody>\n<tr aria-rowindex=\"1\">\n<td data-celllook=\"4369\">\n<h6><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Maximum No. of Students</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335559685&quot;:106,&quot;335559738&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">per Mentor</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:106,&quot;335559738&quot;:114,&quot;335559740&quot;:256}\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" data-celllook=\"4369\">\n<h6><span data-contrast=\"auto\">40-45</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;335559685&quot;:108,&quot;335559738&quot;:114}\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr aria-rowindex=\"2\">\n<td data-celllook=\"4369\">\n<h6><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Frequency of Mentoring</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:106,&quot;335559738&quot;:114,&quot;335559740&quot;:256}\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" data-celllook=\"4369\">\n<h6><span data-contrast=\"auto\">3 to 4 per Semester and more if needed</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:108,&quot;335559738&quot;:114,&quot;335559740&quot;:256}\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr aria-rowindex=\"3\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" data-celllook=\"4369\">\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-contrast=\"